What Is Happening Under the Hood

When you start a call:

The app requests /api/sarvam/.../url from your backend.
The backend forwards the request to Sarvam:
http
GET https://apps.sarvam.ai/api/app-runtime/orgs/019e90d5-be96-7e52-be4a-8ed82cdebbc2/workspaces/019e90d5-becc-7368-93fb-b4856f7600bb/apps/Conversatio-471ae44b-2867/url?interaction_type=call
Header: X-API-Key: <SARVAM_VOICE_AGENTS_API_KEY>
Sarvam AI rejects this request (typically HTTP 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden).
