Paste your active Sarvam API key into .env and restart the API server.
2. Sarvam IDs Mismatch

In artifacts/api-server/src/lib/sarvam.ts, the agent is configured as:

Org ID: 019e90d5-be96-7e52-be4a-8ed82cdebbc2
Workspace ID: 019e90d5-becc-7368-93fb-b4856f7600bb
App ID: Conversatio-471ae44b-2867

If your API key belongs to a different Sarvam account or organization than the one above, or if the agent in Sarvam is in "Draft" rather than "Published", Sarvam will reject authentication.

